    {"dot":"cyan","title":"B06b scope (inference, prompts, knowledge)","items":["Completes B06-ai-platform. Modules: ai-inference (5/2), inference-engines (3/1), prompt-management (22/2), prompt-inspector (3/2), nlp-task-instructions (2/1), knowledge (5/1) = 40 routes / 9 controllers.","Inference/engines: /text-analyses, /safety-checks, /admin/inference-engines/lm-studio. Prompts: admin/runtime prompt-templates plus composed-prompt/preview admin surfaces.","NLP task instructions and knowledge documents are admin surfaces for instruction config and knowledge document management. Grouped endpoint nodes for readability."]},
    {"dot":"violet","title":"Example input/output (representative)","items":["Text analysis/safety check: inference request payloads -> analysis/safety result payloads (verify model selection, moderation/safety semantics, and PII handling).","Inference engines (LM Studio): admin engine/serving requests -> engine status/config/serving responses.","Prompt management/inspector: template CRUD/render/preview requests -> prompt template/composed prompt/preview results (verify variable rendering and consultation preview inputs).","Knowledge/NLP instructions: admin document/instruction CRUD requests -> document/instruction records; knowledge flows may involve indexing/embeddings/retrieval runtime. Verify exact DTOs and async processing."]},
    {"dot":"emerald","title":"Evidence and limitations","items":["Repo https://github.com/ArcaAI/project-hope.git @ 8cb2e5e8e6bbddf5ee7c676782ebb5ad683c23a0. Controller/service sources verified where found (PromptManagementService, ComposedPromptService, KnowledgeDocumentService, LmStudioServingService).","Downstreams: prompts/knowledge/config data store (Postgres/Prisma) and inference/AI runtime (safety/inference backends, LM Studio/engine integrations, knowledge retrieval/embedding pipelines as applicable).","Limitations: grouped endpoint nodes (40 routes/9 controllers); AiInference/SafetyCheck and NLP task instructions service implementation paths not separately verified in this pass; reconcile route/DTO contracts, safety semantics, and retrieval/embedding runtime with OpenAPI/implementation."]}
  ]
